[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238649\">7010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238681\">7010E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238680\">7010E34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238675\">7010D38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238679\">7010E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238519\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238678\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238647\">7010C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238669\">7010D26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238670\">7010D30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238667\">7010D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238666\">7010D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238643\">7010A50</a></p><p>1. Warm up  the trim with hot air and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019045.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Use a new trim.</p><p>Clean off residue adhesive from  the intervention\narea, by using heptane.</p><p>Wet the intervention area with water and\nsoap.</p><p>1. Remove the trim adhesive side protection, and position it in\nits seat.</p><p>Water and soap allows the slidings needed   for the right positioning.</p><p>2. Press on the trim with a sponge  in order to remove air bubbles.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019046.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238643\">7010A50</a>\n                                           A</p><p><a href=\"#/3238666\">7010D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238667\">7010D22</a>